<chapter xml:id="time-series">
  <title>Time Series</title>
  <section xml:id="time-series-order">
    <title>When order matters</title>
    <p>Time-series data break the assumption that observations can be freely rearranged. Trend, seasonality, serial dependence, and structural change become part of the modelling problem.</p>
  </section>
</chapter>
